+    // instructions, and every LDREX took the lock: a game's locks, counters and queues (Uncharted's
+    // thread library) waited for each other across all threads. It differs only where another
+    // thread writes a value and writes it back between an LDREX and its STREX: HENkaku > CPU > Fast
